{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31075","headline":"汉庙祈雨回阳春亭有怀 · 薛能","name":"汉庙祈雨回阳春亭有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南荣轩槛接城闉，适罢祈农此访春。\n九九已从南至尽，芊芊初傍北篱新。\n池中水是前秋雨，陌上风惊自古尘。\n欲召罗敷倾一盏，乘闲言语不容人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}